@startuml
title Delete Role Sequence (/api/superadmin/roles/{roleId})
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor SuperAdmin
boundary "Roles UI" as RolesPage
control "RolesController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
control "RolesController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "RoleManagementService" as RoleService
entity "Role" as RoleEntity
entity "User" as UserEntity
control "RoleManagementRepository" as RoleRepository
control "IRoleManagementRepository" as IRoleManagementRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over RolesPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard calls DeleteRoleAsync through VocaNovaApiClient.
API endpoint is DELETE /api/superadmin/roles/{roleId}.
No request DTO body is used; API returns bool in the response envelope.
System roles cannot be deleted, and roles assigned to users cannot be deleted.
Interfaces used in code: IRoleManagementRepository.
end note
SuperAdmin -> RolesPage: Click Delete role
RolesPage -> DashboardController: POST /roles/{roleId}/delete
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.DeleteRoleAsync(roleId)\nDELETE /api/superadmin/roles/{roleId}
ApiController -> ApiController: Check super admin authorization
ApiController -> RoleService: DeleteAsync(roleId)
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: GetRoleNameAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: GetRoleNameAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Query role name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Role row or null
DbContext -> RoleEntity: Materialize Role?
RoleEntity --> DbContext: Role or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: role name or null
alt Role not found
RoleService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else System role
RoleService --> ApiController: Forbidden result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 403 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Custom role
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: HasUsersWithRoleAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: HasUsersWithRoleAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Check users with role
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT users
MySQL --> DbContext: User row or null
DbContext -> UserEntity: Materialize User?
UserEntity --> DbContext: User or null
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: has users or not
alt Role still assigned to users
RoleService --> ApiController: Conflict result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 409 error
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show error message
else Role can be deleted
RoleService -> RoleService: Begin transaction
RoleService -> IRoleManagementRepository: DeleteRoleAsync(roleId)
IRoleManagementRepository -> RoleRepository: DeleteRoleAsync(roleId)
RoleRepository -> RoleEntity: Remove Role
RoleEntity --> RoleRepository: Role removed
RoleRepository -> DbContext: Track Role removal
DbContext -> MySQL: DELETE roles
MySQL --> DbContext: Delete result
DbContext --> RoleRepository: Save result
RoleRepository --> RoleService: Deleted
RoleService --> ApiController: Success result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK
DashboardController --> RolesPage: Show success and refresh list
end
end
@enduml
